<div id="S5.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#S5.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ 5.3 Reranker-Only Baseline ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ ScoreGate: Adaptive Chunk Selection forRetrieval-Augmented Generationvia Dual-Score Statistical Fusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> extends the baseline comparison with
score-gap stopping (<math id="S5.SS3.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{i}-r_{i+1}&gt;0.02" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.02</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{i}-r_{i+1}&gt;0.02</annotation></semantics></math>) and relative-score
cutoff (<math id="S5.SS3.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{i}\geq 0.5\cdot r_{\max}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>max</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{i}\geq 0.5\cdot r_{\max}</annotation></semantics></math>), both parameter-matched
to maximise <math id="S5.SS3.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> on the validation set.
ScoreGate outperforms all single-signal baselines on Sem. Relevant
recall while maintaining zero false positives.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S5.T8" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span>
