<td id="S5.T9.10.3.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">91.11%</td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T9.10.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S5.T9.10.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb">Sem. Relevant</th>
