<div id="S5.SS4.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS4.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#S5.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ 5.4 ARB Precision and Recall (Internal Validation) ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ ScoreGate: Adaptive Chunk Selection forRetrieval-Augmented Generationvia Dual-Score Statistical Fusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> visualises recall by category.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S5.F5" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2606.14269v1/fig3_recall.png" id="S5.F5.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:405/258;" width="405" height="258" alt="Refer to caption">
